### =====================================================
### WD-5673: Signup availability - POST /Account/signup/availability
### Anónimo con la llave de la app. Siempre 200 con available true/false:
### true solo con SelfSignup:ApiKeys y SelfSignup:DefaultOperatorId configurados.
### =====================================================

### Llave de la app con el registro configurado → available: true
POST {{baseUrl}}/Account/signup/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiKey": "{{apiKey}}"
}

### Llave que no está en SelfSignup:ApiKeys → 200 con available: false (no revela el motivo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Account/signup/availability
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiKey": "no-existe"
}
